  "title" "Antistasi Ultimate - Mafia PvPvEvE Extender"
  "description" "An official-grade Extender for Antistasi Ultimate introducing a 4-way PvPvEvE conflict across the map.

Key Features:
- 4-Way Engine Hostility: BLUFOR (Occupants), OPFOR (Invaders), INDEP (Rebels), and CIV (The Mafia Syndicate).
- Dual Parallel Progression & HQs: Independent headquarters for Petros and Don Salvatore with interactive HQ raiding.
- Contested Cities & Rackets: Dynamically split town support percentages and protection rackets.
- The Mafia Syndicate Faction: Complete template with low-tier starter weapons, formal/casual mobster attire, and syndicate vehicles.
- Global War Level & Targeted Aggro: AI QRFs respond specifically to whichever faction provoked them.

Requirements:
- Arma 3 (v2.06+)
- Antistasi Ultimate - Mod

Source & Issues:
https://github.com/mirrorsedgepro-stack/A3UE-Mafia-PvPvEvE"
  "changenote" "Initial release v1.0.0"
